  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CORE FUNDING TO WHO 2021</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Voluntary core funding to the World Health Organization to support the implementation of the 13th General Programme of Work and notionally earmarked against a strengthened role for WHO in oversight of equity and fairness of the Covid-19 vaccine distribution effort and to remove barriers and improve access to health services for all people with disabilities. The WHO is leading global efforts to contain the spread of COVID-19, and mitigate its impact, especially in countries with weaker health systems.</narrative>
  </description>
